WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.292
- Good morning, BelieveNation.

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:04.459
Today's message is: look beyond rules.

00:00:05.355 --> 00:00:07.744
Over to you, Nicolas Cage.

00:00:07.744 --> 00:00:09.025
(a rooster crows)

00:00:09.025 --> 00:00:11.936
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:11.936 --> 00:00:14.366
♫ Espresso keep me going

00:00:14.366 --> 00:00:18.459
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:18.459 --> 00:00:21.844
- I try to see myself as somebody that

00:00:21.844 --> 00:00:24.259
is interested in extremes.

00:00:24.259 --> 00:00:27.062
That is interested in
maybe breaking boundaries,

00:00:27.062 --> 00:00:29.297
in terms of what is considered

00:00:29.297 --> 00:00:31.298
acceptable or not acceptable to do.

00:00:31.298 --> 00:00:35.168
I don't like the idea of
rules in art (laughs),

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:36.654
I once said a long time,

00:00:36.654 --> 00:00:38.213
- That's one place where you
don't find a lot of rules.

00:00:38.213 --> 00:00:39.546
- Yeah, and, uh,

00:00:40.683 --> 00:00:42.689
I once said, I think in a magazine,

00:00:42.689 --> 00:00:44.240
that to be a good actor,

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:45.780
you have to be something of a criminal.

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:47.313
Of course, they took that as, like,

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:48.321
I wanted to be a criminal.

00:00:48.321 --> 00:00:49.291
Which isn't true.

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.132
I just, I just think that you,

00:00:51.132 --> 00:00:52.778
you need to look beyond rules.

00:00:52.778 --> 00:00:54.763
- I think this is really, really, really,

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.011
really, really important.

00:00:56.011 --> 00:00:57.902
You need to understand

00:00:57.902 --> 00:01:00.147
that rules are created for people who

00:01:00.147 --> 00:01:03.345
have below average skills at something.

00:01:03.345 --> 00:01:04.988
If you think about

00:01:04.988 --> 00:01:06.536
a classroom that you went to,

00:01:06.536 --> 00:01:07.580
maybe you went to university,

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.921
to college, or high school,

00:01:08.921 --> 00:01:10.233
and you're sitting in the class,

00:01:10.233 --> 00:01:12.327
you got 20, 50, 100, 500 people

00:01:12.327 --> 00:01:13.639
sitting there with you,

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:16.469
the material is designed

00:01:16.469 --> 00:01:19.081
to teach the below average person.

00:01:19.081 --> 00:01:20.157
At that skill set.

00:01:20.157 --> 00:01:21.075
Right?

00:01:21.075 --> 00:01:24.145
It's designed so that
almost everybody can get it.

00:01:24.145 --> 00:01:26.808
And, as a result, the pace is so slow

00:01:26.808 --> 00:01:28.918
that if you're really good at that stuff,

00:01:28.918 --> 00:01:30.521
you're bored.

00:01:30.521 --> 00:01:32.501
And a lot of you who've
been through those classes,

00:01:32.501 --> 00:01:33.527
know what I'm talking about.

00:01:33.527 --> 00:01:34.802
Where, if you went,

00:01:34.802 --> 00:01:36.556
and talked to the professor, the teacher,

00:01:36.556 --> 00:01:38.287
the person who's teaching the material,

00:01:38.287 --> 00:01:39.848
and you sat down with them for an hour,

00:01:39.848 --> 00:01:42.005
you'd learn way, way, way, way more

00:01:42.005 --> 00:01:45.156
because it's customized to you.

00:01:45.156 --> 00:01:48.026
And the same principle
applies to your life.

00:01:48.026 --> 00:01:50.044
And it applies to your business.

00:01:50.044 --> 00:01:52.043
Understand that most of the rules

00:01:52.043 --> 00:01:53.709
that you're paying attention to

00:01:53.709 --> 00:01:55.259
in your life and your business,

00:01:55.259 --> 00:01:56.342
were designed

00:01:57.268 --> 00:02:00.978
for the below average
person at that skill level.

00:02:00.978 --> 00:02:03.208
And if all you do,

00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:04.573
is follow the rules,

00:02:04.573 --> 00:02:06.662
follow the way that
everybody else does it,

00:02:06.662 --> 00:02:10.337
you're going to have a
below average experience.

00:02:10.337 --> 00:02:11.340
If you just sell the same product

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.626
for the same price,

00:02:12.626 --> 00:02:14.227
and you have the same marketing,

00:02:14.227 --> 00:02:15.468
have the same website,

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:17.125
if you're just copying somebody else,

00:02:17.125 --> 00:02:18.684
and just following the rules,

00:02:18.684 --> 00:02:19.517
you're going to have a

00:02:19.517 --> 00:02:21.600
below average experience.

00:02:22.729 --> 00:02:24.365
What you need to do,

00:02:24.365 --> 00:02:26.901
with that example of
talking to the professor,

00:02:26.901 --> 00:02:29.181
where you customize the experience,

00:02:29.181 --> 00:02:30.523
you need to apply that same principle

00:02:30.523 --> 00:02:32.591
to your life and your business, as well.

00:02:32.591 --> 00:02:33.461
You need to think,

00:02:33.461 --> 00:02:35.329
how do I customize

00:02:35.329 --> 00:02:37.024
my life, and my business,

00:02:37.024 --> 00:02:39.084
to make it suit me?

00:02:39.084 --> 00:02:41.672
So I can have the greatest value,

00:02:41.672 --> 00:02:42.852
and the greatest impact,

00:02:42.852 --> 00:02:44.334
on the people around me.

00:02:44.334 --> 00:02:45.460
On my customers,

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:46.444
on my community,

00:02:46.444 --> 00:02:47.435
on the world.

00:02:47.435 --> 00:02:48.996
You need to figure out ways

00:02:48.996 --> 00:02:50.825
to customize what you do

00:02:50.825 --> 00:02:52.224
so that it fits you,

00:02:52.224 --> 00:02:53.673
your unique talents,

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:54.541
your unique gifts,

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:56.691
and you can't do it by
following the rules.

00:02:56.691 --> 00:03:00.182
If you look at every successful business,

00:03:00.182 --> 00:03:01.657
in history,

00:03:01.657 --> 00:03:02.648
go look them up,

00:03:02.648 --> 00:03:03.481
who ever you look up to,

00:03:03.481 --> 00:03:05.255
whatever the company
is that you look up to,

00:03:05.255 --> 00:03:07.103
whatever entrepreneur it
is that you look up to,

00:03:07.103 --> 00:03:10.397
they did not follow the rules.

00:03:10.397 --> 00:03:12.278
They did things in their own way,

00:03:12.278 --> 00:03:15.050
and they paved a new path,

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:16.180
instead of being a sheep

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:17.911
and following the existing path.

00:03:17.911 --> 00:03:19.959
That's what you need to do for yourself.

00:03:19.959 --> 00:03:22.747
You cannot bring yourself down,

00:03:22.747 --> 00:03:24.102
to the below average standards.

00:03:24.102 --> 00:03:25.628
Now that doesn't mean you have to go

00:03:25.628 --> 00:03:27.507
and break all rules, right?

00:03:27.507 --> 00:03:29.527
Some rules, you know, you're
going to get in trouble

00:03:29.527 --> 00:03:31.007
if you break, right?

00:03:31.007 --> 00:03:32.868
If you are speeding, you're
going to get a ticket,

00:03:32.868 --> 00:03:34.032
you got to deal with that.

00:03:34.032 --> 00:03:35.136
There are other rules that have

00:03:35.136 --> 00:03:37.327
much bigger consequences as well.

00:03:37.327 --> 00:03:38.420
But very few of the rules that

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:40.014
you currently feel are important,

00:03:40.014 --> 00:03:41.459
actually are.

00:03:41.459 --> 00:03:43.076
And what you need to do is think about

00:03:43.076 --> 00:03:44.833
how do I take my genius,

00:03:44.833 --> 00:03:45.666
my talent,

00:03:45.666 --> 00:03:47.654
what I'm really, really good at,

00:03:47.654 --> 00:03:49.630
and apply that to this industry

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:51.183
in a way that it's never been done before?

00:03:51.183 --> 00:03:53.030
Other sheep are out selling it this way,

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:54.506
this is how they market,

00:03:54.506 --> 00:03:55.352
this is how they sell,

00:03:55.352 --> 00:03:56.185
this is how they promote.

00:03:56.185 --> 00:03:58.069
If you're not good at that,

00:03:58.069 --> 00:03:59.120
if that's not driving you,

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:01.105
if you can't be the best
in the world at that,

00:04:01.105 --> 00:04:01.975
forget that.

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:03.395
Who cares if that works in that industry?

00:04:03.395 --> 00:04:05.024
Who cares if that's the traditional way

00:04:05.024 --> 00:04:06.547
everybody else is selling?

00:04:06.547 --> 00:04:08.058
Let them play out here.

00:04:08.058 --> 00:04:09.551
You're going to come over here.

00:04:09.551 --> 00:04:11.160
You're going to do this thing

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:12.439
that only you can do,

00:04:12.439 --> 00:04:14.164
that you can be the best in the world at,

00:04:14.164 --> 00:04:15.580
that get people excited about,

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:17.050
that nobody's ever done before,

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:18.313
that's what you're going to do.

00:04:18.313 --> 00:04:19.638
That's how you're going to stand out.

00:04:19.638 --> 00:04:21.124
That's how you're going to win customers.

00:04:21.124 --> 00:04:22.436
That's how you're going to feel happy.

00:04:22.436 --> 00:04:24.169
That's how you're going to feel fulfilled.

00:04:24.169 --> 00:04:25.002
That's about being you.

00:04:25.002 --> 00:04:26.715
Bringing your genius, your talent,

00:04:26.715 --> 00:04:28.779
your abilities, your
excitement, your passion

00:04:28.779 --> 00:04:29.683
to your industry

00:04:29.683 --> 00:04:31.778
in a way that's never been done before.

00:04:31.778 --> 00:04:34.048
You have to do it if
you want to stand out.

00:04:34.048 --> 00:04:36.897
You have to do it if you
want to have a big impact.

00:04:36.897 --> 00:04:38.889
You can't just follow the rules.

00:04:38.889 --> 00:04:40.998
Rules are great guidelines to start with.

00:04:40.998 --> 00:04:42.088
It's good to know, in general,

00:04:42.088 --> 00:04:43.309
how something is working.

00:04:43.309 --> 00:04:44.544
It's good to know where some

00:04:44.544 --> 00:04:45.777
of the penalties are.

00:04:45.777 --> 00:04:48.095
But don't let that shackle you

00:04:48.095 --> 00:04:50.626
in that this is the only way to do it.

00:04:50.626 --> 00:04:52.995
You need to understand,

00:04:52.995 --> 00:04:54.634
and then go out and do your own thing.

00:04:54.634 --> 00:04:56.611
This is why I love modeling success.

00:04:56.611 --> 00:04:58.482
Because, when you model success,

00:04:58.482 --> 00:05:00.440
when you look at people
in a different industry,

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:02.367
look at any entrepreneur
that you look up to,

00:05:02.367 --> 00:05:04.807
if you are in the car business,

00:05:04.807 --> 00:05:05.734
you can go learn from

00:05:05.734 --> 00:05:06.614
a Steve Jobs,

00:05:06.614 --> 00:05:07.447
or Oprah Winfrey,

00:05:07.447 --> 00:05:08.280
or Martha Stewart,

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.793
someone who's totally
outside the industry.

00:05:09.793 --> 00:05:11.897
You can take something that worked

00:05:11.897 --> 00:05:13.659
for Howard Schultz, who started Starbucks,

00:05:13.659 --> 00:05:17.019
and apply to your chair
manufacturing business.

00:05:17.019 --> 00:05:19.270
In a way that nobody's
ever done it before.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.455
And it feels like you, you're this

00:05:21.455 --> 00:05:23.221
pioneer trailblazer

00:05:23.221 --> 00:05:24.706
breaking all the rules,

00:05:24.706 --> 00:05:26.383
when it's just learning from somebody else

00:05:26.383 --> 00:05:27.508
who's done it in a different industry.

00:05:27.508 --> 00:05:29.249
But you're not going to have success

00:05:29.249 --> 00:05:30.989
as a chair manufacturer

00:05:30.989 --> 00:05:33.650
doing what all the other
chair manufacturers are doing.

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:34.834
It's not going to work.

00:05:34.834 --> 00:05:35.893
You're going to end up with

00:05:35.893 --> 00:05:37.615
below average results.

00:05:37.615 --> 00:05:39.685
Customize your life,

00:05:39.685 --> 00:05:40.759
and your business,

00:05:40.759 --> 00:05:43.450
to the genius that you have inside.

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:44.429
Express yourself.

00:05:44.429 --> 00:05:45.809
Let it come out.

00:05:45.809 --> 00:05:47.035
Let it fulfill you.

00:05:47.035 --> 00:05:48.717
Let your audience feel it.

00:05:48.717 --> 00:05:50.098
Let your customers feel it.

00:05:50.098 --> 00:05:51.931
Let the media feel it.

00:05:53.187 --> 00:05:55.375
That's where your success
is going to come from.

00:05:55.375 --> 00:05:56.816
Financial success,

00:05:56.816 --> 00:05:57.790
emotional success,

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.351
personal success,

00:05:59.351 --> 00:06:00.954
that's where it's going to come from.

00:06:00.954 --> 00:06:03.542
Stop paying attention to the rules.

00:06:03.542 --> 00:06:06.197
As Steve Jobs famously said,

00:06:06.197 --> 00:06:08.180
"You'll discover, at some point,

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.629
"that the rules are designed by people

00:06:09.629 --> 00:06:11.887
"who are no smarter than you."

00:06:11.887 --> 00:06:14.126
And so why are you living your life,

00:06:14.126 --> 00:06:16.103
running your business,

00:06:16.103 --> 00:06:18.574
according to other people's expectations?

00:06:18.574 --> 00:06:19.965
According to what other people

00:06:19.965 --> 00:06:21.553
say you need to do?

00:06:21.553 --> 00:06:23.071
Instead of letting this gift,

00:06:23.071 --> 00:06:24.555
this art,

00:06:24.555 --> 00:06:26.500
come out and dominate.

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:28.438
So the question of the day, today, is:

00:06:28.438 --> 00:06:30.475
I want to know, what are the rules

00:06:30.475 --> 00:06:32.479
that you're breaking in your industry,

00:06:32.479 --> 00:06:34.017
or in your life?

00:06:34.017 --> 00:06:35.322
Super curious to find out.

00:06:35.322 --> 00:06:36.438
Leaving the comments below,

00:06:36.438 --> 00:06:37.705
I'm going to join in the discussion.

00:06:37.705 --> 00:06:39.698
I also want to give a
quick shout out to Sheri,

00:06:39.698 --> 00:06:41.443
from optisourcebook.com.

00:06:41.443 --> 00:06:42.749
Sheri, thank you so much for picking

00:06:42.749 --> 00:06:44.306
up a copy of my book, Your One Word,

00:06:44.306 --> 00:06:46.289
it really, really,
really means a lot to me.

00:06:46.289 --> 00:06:48.104
Thank you guys again for watching.

00:06:48.104 --> 00:06:49.311
I believe in you.

00:06:49.311 --> 00:06:51.307
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself.

00:06:51.307 --> 00:06:53.251
And whatever your one word is.

00:06:53.251 --> 00:06:54.824
And I'll see you again tomorrow morning

00:06:54.824 --> 00:06:56.180
for another shot

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.249
of #Entspresso.

00:06:57.249 --> 00:07:00.340
♫ I wake up every morning

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:03.825
♫ Espresso keep me going

00:07:03.825 --> 00:07:04.658
So, for the past few months,

00:07:04.658 --> 00:07:06.877
I've been getting a lot
of comments on my videos,

00:07:06.877 --> 00:07:09.365
and people asking me,

00:07:09.365 --> 00:07:11.157
am I related to Nicolas Cage?

00:07:11.157 --> 00:07:13.181
I look a lot like Nicolas Cage.

00:07:13.181 --> 00:07:15.139
And, to me, this is just

00:07:15.139 --> 00:07:16.672
totally ridiculous.

00:07:16.672 --> 00:07:19.240
Because everybody looks like Nicolas Cage.

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:21.564
And I have the proof to back it up.

00:07:21.564 --> 00:07:23.451
Pregnant women look like Nicolas Cage.

00:07:23.451 --> 00:07:25.464
Your rib cage looks like Nicolas Cage.

00:07:25.464 --> 00:07:27.682
E.T. looks like Nicolas Cage.

00:07:27.682 --> 00:07:28.515
Gandolf,

00:07:29.395 --> 00:07:30.644
Yoda,

00:07:30.644 --> 00:07:32.226
Hillary Clinton,

00:07:32.226 --> 00:07:33.531
Little Mermaid,

00:07:33.531 --> 00:07:35.069
Mona Lisa,

00:07:35.069 --> 00:07:36.585
Bill Clinton,

00:07:36.585 --> 00:07:38.046
Albert Einstein,

00:07:38.046 --> 00:07:40.261
the Statue of Liberty,

00:07:40.261 --> 00:07:41.094
Biggie,

00:07:42.287 --> 00:07:43.921
Buzz Lightyear,

00:07:43.921 --> 00:07:45.343
Princess Leia,

00:07:45.343 --> 00:07:46.595
the Green Lantern,

00:07:46.595 --> 00:07:47.595
Miley Cyrus,

00:07:48.587 --> 00:07:49.598
Barack Obama,

00:07:49.598 --> 00:07:51.474
everybody looks like Nicolas Cage.

00:07:51.474 --> 00:07:53.396
I don't know why you guys would say that,

00:07:53.396 --> 00:07:55.105
but I'm deeply hurt.

00:07:55.105 --> 00:07:57.228
I'm taking names.

00:07:57.228 --> 00:07:59.140
And I'm going to remember who you are.

